| `line.split(" ")` + brittle index access | `LINE_RE`, `USER_RE`, `API_RE` — regex patterns |
| No types, no docs | Full type hints + docstrings on every function |
| `open()` without context manager | `with open(...)` (except seed-bootstrap in `__main__` which is intentionally minimal) |
